{"id":139184074,"slug":"ptsd-emdr-and-tfps-jeremy-fox-pc","title":"PTSD, EMDR, and TFPs: Jeremy Fox, P.C. Joins for a Conversation About Trauma Therapy and The Brain","subtitle":"A Frontier OG from Our Clubhouse Era Joins for A Podcast!","post_date":"2023-11-27T14:50:19.333Z","audience":"everyone","type":"podcast","canonical_url":"https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/p/ptsd-emdr-and-tfps-jeremy-fox-pc","wordcount":218,"source":"api","fetched_at":"2026-09-13T21:55:52.714Z","body_sha256":"a7c7ca6a4cd81c861e90b1cb9f43bf793809964ec4271b677647903dc26dd780","text_words":219,"complete":true,"body_html":"<p>The Frontier Psychiatrists is a health-themed media empire(!) with a newsletter as its home base here on Substack.  It started as conversations on the <a href=\"https://www.google.com/url?sa=t&amp;rct=j&amp;q=&amp;esrc=s&amp;source=web&amp;cd=&amp;ved=2ahUKEwiI4vyWnOOCAxXjF1kFHbL7CpoQFnoECA4QAw&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.theverge.com%2F2021%2F9%2F28%2F22696403%2Fclubhouse-creators-first-sponsorship-program%23%3A~%3Atext%3DAs%2520the%2520inaugural%2520class%2520of%2Cpitching%2520their%2520live%2520audio%2520shows.&amp;usg=AOvVaw3wa8DMnl1ZNaCd28wZt1Hv&amp;opi=89978449\">app Clubhouse</a>, and one of our—<a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/owen-m-53345b7/\">Owen</a> and <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/carlene-macmillan-md-5a9a352a/\">Carlene</a>’s— earliest friends is <a href=\"https://rightfitcounseling.com/blog/what-is-emdr-therapy/\">Jeremy Fox</a>—a licensed professional counselor. He’s a specialist in trauma, an <a href=\"https://www.emdr.com/what-is-emdr/\">EMDR</a> trainer, and a great explainer of things complex.  I also think he is a decent human I love talking to.  In this interview, we dig into the neuroscience of EMDR—eye movement desensitization and reprogramming—for trauma and more.  Please share with your friends, and give the show a follow-up and 5-star review on <a href=\"https://www.google.com/url?sa=t&amp;rct=j&amp;q=&amp;esrc=s&amp;source=web&amp;cd=&amp;cad=rja&amp;uact=8&amp;ved=2ahUKEwjr4L7MnOOCAxX1L1kFHVbnDCEQFnoECA0QAQ&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fopen.spotify.com%2Fshow%2F5tOLVK3Xx2mrWvQzfYW0pO&amp;usg=AOvVaw07pvR9K8Q1TLsto3VaVEnY&amp;opi=89978449\">Spotify</a>, <a href=\"https://www.google.com/url?sa=t&amp;rct=j&amp;q=&amp;esrc=s&amp;source=web&amp;cd=&amp;cad=rja&amp;uact=8&amp;ved=2ahUKEwi508fBnOOCAxWXElkFHcA4A0wQFnoECA0QAQ&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fembed.podcasts.apple.com%2Fus%2Fpodcast%2Fthe-frontier-psychiatrists%2Fid1577248149&amp;usg=AOvVaw0ShHDJTNq8AD0EAEQbZXcl&amp;opi=89978449\">Apple podcasts</a>, etc.</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Gv0I!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F719446f0-1ba9-4194-8f6c-2ba8a6c5a8e1_1200x887.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Gv0I!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F719446f0-1ba9-4194-8f6c-2ba8a6c5a8e1_1200x887.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Gv0I!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F719446f0-1ba9-4194-8f6c-2ba8a6c5a8e1_1200x887.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Gv0I!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F719446f0-1ba9-4194-8f6c-2ba8a6c5a8e1_1200x887.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Gv0I!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F719446f0-1ba9-4194-8f6c-2ba8a6c5a8e1_1200x887.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Gv0I!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F719446f0-1ba9-4194-8f6c-2ba8a6c5a8e1_1200x887.jpeg\" width=\"1200\" height=\"887\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/719446f0-1ba9-4194-8f6c-2ba8a6c5a8e1_1200x887.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:887,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:332490,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:null,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Gv0I!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F719446f0-1ba9-4194-8f6c-2ba8a6c5a8e1_1200x887.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Gv0I!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F719446f0-1ba9-4194-8f6c-2ba8a6c5a8e1_1200x887.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Gv0I!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F719446f0-1ba9-4194-8f6c-2ba8a6c5a8e1_1200x887.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Gv0I!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F719446f0-1ba9-4194-8f6c-2ba8a6c5a8e1_1200x887.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>Here is us with the lord of Winterfell, given Winter is Coming.  He needs a better coat.  </p><div><hr></div><h4>Advertising For Other Things Section!</h4><p>I work at a practice in NYC for those interested in neuromodulation-first approaches to mental health problems. That means not drugs. It’s called <a href=\"https://www.fermata.health\">Fermata</a>. </p><p>We are enrolling for the fMRI Guided Depression Trial: The <a href=\"https://www.fermata.health/clinical-trials\">SAINT OLO Study!</a>  If you are interested in the treatments we discuss, you can either become a patient or enroll in a research trial, depending on what is right for you.  A note: <a href=\"https://www.fermata.health/clinical-trials\">Some of our trials (like SAINT) require payment from patients, and we pay you for others (like TDetect).</a></p><p></p><p></p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p></p>","text":"The Frontier Psychiatrists is a health-themed media empire(!) with a newsletter as its home base here on Substack. It started as conversations on the app Clubhouse , and one of our— Owen and Carlene ’s— earliest friends is Jeremy Fox —a licensed professional counselor. He’s a specialist in trauma, an EMDR trainer, and a great explainer of things complex. I also think he is a decent human I love talking to. In this interview, we dig into the neuroscience of EMDR—eye movement desensitization and reprogramming—for trauma and more. Please share with your friends, and give the show a follow-up and 5-star review on Spotify , Apple podcasts , etc.\n\nHere is us with the lord of Winterfell, given Winter is Coming. He needs a better coat.\n\nAdvertising For Other Things Section!\n\nI work at a practice in NYC for those interested in neuromodulation-first approaches to mental health problems. That means not drugs. It’s called Fermata .\n\nWe are enrolling for the fMRI Guided Depression Trial: The SAINT OLO Study! If you are interested in the treatments we discuss, you can either become a patient or enroll in a research trial, depending on what is right for you. A note: Some of our trials (like SAINT) require payment from patients, and we pay you for others (like TDetect).\n\nSubscribe now"}